            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR restructures the Learning area HTML module \"test your skills\" navigation, in the same way as <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3252955241\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40503\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40503/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40503\">#40503</a> did for the a11y module.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See the linked PR for more information on motivation, etc.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40815",
            "title": "Restructure the HTML test your skills navigation",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-20T13:54:08.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-20T13:51:45.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Using <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp;</code> inside <code class=\"notranslate\">@scope</code> changes according to spec updates (and relation to <code class=\"notranslate\">:scope</code>).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This makes <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp; &amp;</code> redundant as far as I can see. The explainer has good context and I hope I've conveyed that in these changes.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Explainer:</strong> <a href=\"https://css.oddbird.net/scope/parent-selector/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://css.oddbird.net/scope/parent-selector/</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Bugs</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1975531\" rel=\"nofollow\">Change <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp;</code> behaviour inside <code class=\"notranslate\">@scope</code> block as per spec resolution</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Parent issue <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249101586\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40481\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40481/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40481\">#40481</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> relnote <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3337599065\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40809\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40809/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40809\">#40809</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40814",
            "title": "docs(Fx142): css ampersand in at-scope content and `:scope`",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-20T12:52:37.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-20T12:50:15.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "bsmth",
                "url": "https://github.com/bsmth"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 139 adds support for the <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#attr-button-command-request-close\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">request-close</code></a> value of the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;button&gt;</code> element's <code class=\"notranslate\">command</code> attribute. See <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5592399713402880\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5592399713402880</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The value was already documented, but I took this opportunity to clean up the content and add some missing explanations and links.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
