                "name": "wbamberg",
                "url": "https://github.com/wbamberg"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145676?u=d9e4353115d1dcae2ff7be06802522be0a4323df&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Some more fixes as a follow-up from <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3330512741\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40782\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40782/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40782\">#40782</a>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Cited some text from the design doc</li>\n<li>Clarified handshake</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fix some incorrect statements.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1La1ehXw76HP6n1uUeks-WJGFgAnpX2tCjKts7QFJ57Y/edit?pli=1&amp;tab=t.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1La1ehXw76HP6n1uUeks-WJGFgAnpX2tCjKts7QFJ57Y/edit?pli=1&amp;tab=t.0</a></p>",
