        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>adds the information that clicking an extension suggestion in the address bar (omnibox) is now a user action, including a release note.</li>\n<li>adds details of all the user action enabled APIs.</li>\n<li>tidies up the content on the user action page.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In addition to the change requested as part of a dev-doc-needed, the user actions page seemed hard to read and didn't provide a comprehensive guide to the related API's.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1542358\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1542358</a> Allow omnibox.onInputEntered as a user action trigger e.g. for clipboard &amp; browserAction.openPopup()</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40734",
            "title": "Bug-1542358 omnibox.onInputEntered is a user action trigger",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-14T11:21:43.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-14T11:19:25.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "rebloor",
                "url": "https://github.com/rebloor"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-mixins-1/#defining-custom-functions\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS custom functions</a> have <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5179721933651968\" rel=\"nofollow\">landed in Chrome 139</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR documents all of the associated sub-features that make up this feature. Specifically, it adds pages for:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">@function</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">type()</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;dashed-function&gt;</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">CSSFunctionRule</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">CSSFunctionDeclarations</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">CSSFunctionDescriptors</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Module landing page for the \"CSS Custom Functions and Mixins\" module</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Usage guide</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40703",
            "title": "Technical review: Document CSS custom functions",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-19T15:17:14.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-12T13:00:39.000Z",
